s:</strong> Affiliates will earn a commission on qualifying sales generated through their unique affiliate links. Commissions are calculated based on net sales revenue and paid out according to the agreed-upon commission structure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Payouts:</strong> Commissions will be paid out to affiliates on a monthly basis, subject to a minimum payout threshold and any applicable withholding taxes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Cookie Duration:</strong> Affiliate cookies have a standard duration of 30 days, during which affiliates will receive credit for any qualifying purchases made by referred customers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Ethical Promotion:</strong> Affiliates are expected to promote SOWLHome products in a fair and ethical manner, refraining from engaging in any deceptive, misleading, or spammy promotional tactics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Termination:</strong> SOWLHome reserves the right to terminate the affiliate partnership at any time for violation of these terms or for any other reason deemed appropriate by SOWLHome.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Updates:</strong> These terms and conditions are subject to change at the discretion of SOWLHome. Affiliates will be notified of any updates or modifications to the terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">By applying to the SOWLHome Affiliate Program, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to abide by these terms and conditions.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\r\n<div class=\"text-gray-400 flex self-end lg:self-center items-center justify-center lg:justify-start mt-0 -ml-1 h-7 gap-[2px] visible\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md p-1 text-xs text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary md:invisible md:group-hover:visible md